  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞回过神来的美鹤有些慌乱……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_221.bf.json:10:1",
